I enter a clothing shop.
There are many people here.
There is a lot of noise in this shop.
The monsoon is coming very soon.
Therefore, I need a raincoat.
I look at a shopkeeper.
I say, "Bhaiya, I need a good raincoat."
The shopkeeper shows me a blue raincoat.
It is beautiful, but it is small.
"This is too small," I say.
"Do you have a bigger raincoat than this?"
"The Mumbai rain is very heavy."
He says yes, and brings a yellow raincoat.
"This yellow raincoat is stronger than the blue one," he says.
I look at the yellow raincoat.
It is larger and thicker.
This is perfect for the monsoon.
"I will buy this yellow raincoat," I tell the shopkeeper.
